====Usage notes====
*[[ganga]] / [[fara]] [[í]] '''áir''' - go to the river in order to fish trouts (''Svabo'' 18th century; described in ''Føroysk orðabók'' 1998 as local dialect of [[Vágar]] and fishing trouts in a lake)

